<title>NEW ZEALAND: JP Morgan has bigger stake in Fletcher.</title>
<headline>JP Morgan has bigger stake in Fletcher.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Investment Management Australia Ltd said on Friday it now had a relevant stake of 8.05 percent in Fletcher Challenge Paper Division against 5.06 percent previously.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
